<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Click Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Click rents by the month in Hanoi at a verified 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND, and the exact figure inside that range depends on the machine and the terms, so it is confirmed with the desk rather than estimated. This guide plans a monthly rental around that range: what a month buys, how it beats weekly booking, what to check in a long-term agreement, and when a shorter period is the better structure.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price range, the Click as a month-long companion, a realistic monthly budget, the break-even against the 700,000 VND weekly rate and the 150,000 VND daily rate, and the deposit, gear, fuel and maintenance questions that a long-term rental adds. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
